---
title: A tool call
---
%% An agent checks a diagram with Omaspec and asks a person before it
%% changes the file. What the agent gets is held against its life cycle
%% (agent.puml), in the other language.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Agent
  participant Omaspec
  Person->>Agent: task
  Agent->>Agent: picks a tool
  Agent->>Omaspec: lint door.puml
  Omaspec-->>Agent: 2 findings, each with its fix
  Agent->>Agent: wants a change
  Agent->>Person: make the 2 fixes?
  alt yes
    Person->>Agent: approved
    Agent->>Omaspec: lint --fix door.puml
    Omaspec-->>Agent: fixed 2
    Agent->>Agent: answers
    Agent-->>Person: door.puml is clean
  else no
    Person->>Agent: denied
    Agent->>Agent: answers
    Agent-->>Person: left as it was
  end
